  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "5HPNs",
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub></math> is&nbsp;more&nbsp;soluble than <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub></math>.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "iFVET",
      "text": "<math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> is tetrahedral in shape.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qLWN9",
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub></math> is the primary standard in volumetry.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "uNPYo",
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> has a <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> bond.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>It is true <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>Na</mtext></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>Cr</mtext></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mtext>7</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;more&nbsp;soluble than <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>K</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>Cr</mtext></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mtext>7</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math>.<br /><math> <mrow> <msubsup> <mrow> <mtext>CrO</mtext></mrow> <mn>4</mn> <mrow> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </msubsup> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;Is tetrahedral:<br />&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e048e390-11a7-4cba-8e58-0123773e149a-1024px-Chromat-Ion.svg.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px;\" /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4bb5c02f-f60e-4f02-b16c-86ba243f65b6-download.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 198px;\" /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub></math> is not the primary standard but <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub></math> (acidic) is&nbsp;the&nbsp;primary&nbsp;standard reagent for titration because sodium dichromate is Hygroscopic in nature, that means it absorb moisture from atmosphere, that will cause incorrect reading in titration.</p>",
